op max mx mx amt
op mul t amt w.surge_alloy
op add sw sw t
sensor amt core @spore-pod
op max mx mx amt
sensor amt core @blast-compound
op max mx mx amt
op mul t amt w.blast_compound
op add sw sw t
sensor amt core @pyratite
op max mx mx amt
op mul t amt w.pyratite
op add sw sw t
op max mx mx 1
op mul sum mx 16.92
op sub sum sum sw
jump p3 greaterThan sum 0
jump r1 always
p3:
set cu 0
op div rcp npad sum
set cnt 0
set p 0
set nc 0
set busy 0
sensor amt core @copper
op sub d mx amt
op mul d d w.copper
jump s0 lessThanEq d 0
op add cu cu d
op mul tk cu rcp
op floor tk tk
jump s0 greaterThanEq cnt tk
set it @copper
